      "metadata": {},
      "source": [
        "Overall, I was able to successfully replicate the simulations from the paper, albeit with reduced sample sizes and fewer simulations for faster computation. The results demonstrate the decrease in bias when using the nested CV approach compared to the standard CV approach. It would still be interesting to explore further simulations with larger datasets and a smaller number of features to see how the bias changes as the dataset dimensions change. "
